WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.140
During the Steamed Stuffed Bun Battle,

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.640
Pastry King Luogen and Steel Bar Xie,

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.210
are neck and neck.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:38.180
It's hard to decide who is better.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.200
This is the unique Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.330
that the Bailuo family invented

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:44.580
1,600 years ago

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.950
and are proud of.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.440
This is Golden Laughing Bun,

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:53.640
a golden bun that can laugh.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.530
The result will be revealed soon.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:01.770
OK.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:02.590
Well, first,

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.360
those who vote for Steel Bar Xie,

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.020
raise your red spoons.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.000
Please.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.230
Another Set of Seven-Star Knives

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.140
Enigmatic Beauty Xiang En

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.250
What…

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.370
Why does nobody raise the red spoon?

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.490
Is this some kind of joke?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.130
Seems Luogen wins.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.320
He is indeed more awesome.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.010
He has a hundred-year experience

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.550
and1,600-year tradition of cooking.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:46.760
No matter how super one is,

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:47.670
it’s not easy to

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.190
surpass the rival.

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.360
How could this happen?

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.490
I totally lost.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.540
Let's look at the votes

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.870
for Pastry King Luogen.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.050
Please raise your white spoons.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:11.860
Those supporting Pastry King Luogen,

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.020
please raise your white spoon.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:16.300
What happened?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.590
No one raised white spoon.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.330
What's going on?

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.300
Mr. Zhang, what happened?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.410
Why no one chose any of the two buns?

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.530
Do you remember

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.110
the story about the Spear and the Shield

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.140
I told you

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.910
when you were young?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.180
The Spear and the Shield.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.260
Long time ago,

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.920
there was a man in the State of Chu,

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.310
selling the spear that can thrust through objects

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:53.670
and the shield

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.060
that nothing can thrust through.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.310
So what?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.270
Right! Good point.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.580
Chef Xie’s Golden Laughing Bun

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:03.680
(Golden Laughing Bun)
is an innovative fried bun

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:04.780
(Golden Laughing Bun)
that surprised everyone

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.400
(Golden Laughing Bun)
and pleased everyone.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.530
It is exactly

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.760
the Spear in the story.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.130
Well,

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.450
Luogen’s Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun,

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.440
(Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun)
no matter the dough or the stuff,

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.870
(Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun)
brings together the 1,600-year

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.590
(Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun) wisdom and technology.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.670
It’s exactly the Shield in the story.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:28.980
Right.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.710
So how about thrusting the spear

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.120
through the shield?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:33.930
When the business man

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.420
was asked,

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.930
he could only stand there speechless.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:38.990
We are in the same mood

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.030
as the businessman.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.710
That is, we’re self-contradictory.

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.170
Self-contradictory?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.210
So neither decision is right.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.420
But it’s also a fact

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.090
that the strongest shield

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.130
and the sharpest spear can’t be compared.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:54.780
The competition result

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.840
is a self-contradictory one.

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:58.560
That means

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.800
it’s a tie competition.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:02.320
A tie!

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:06.890
A tie!

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:09.470
How could it be a tie?

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:10.700
I can’t accept it.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.270
The little brat’s bun

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.140
is so funny.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:19.890
The geezer always

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.140
crowed about its traditional history.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:23.590
How could a bun containing rotten dough

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.120
be good?

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.280
They’re eating the rival’s bun.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.750
I wonder how it tastes.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.390
What the hell does it taste?

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:40.350
I’ll eat one.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.210
Silang.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.060
It’s delicious.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.660
Both of their buns are delicious.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:46.520
Silang, you’re eating too much.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.630
You two, enough!

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.380
What kind of old-fashioned bun is this?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.880
It doesn’t deserve the first place.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.890
Do you think

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.280
you could win me

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.150
with your dirty trick?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.740
What did you say, geezer?

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:10.130
Why did you write characters on the buns?

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:11.660
No one will have appetite after seeing them.

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:12.590
Little brat.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:13.340
Look at your buns.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.740
They made my hands so greasy!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.990
What do you say?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.630
Doesn’t it just

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.010
moisturize your dry hands?

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.250
You’re going too far, brat!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.950
I haven't finished.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.250
Why did you make a boat-shape food steamer?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.960
Can you stop being so weird?

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:29.710
Idiot!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.600
The shape of boat can circulate the bamboo fragrance fully.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.870
Look at your dragon.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.690
People will think

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.280
it’s useless freak.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.730
They are really well matched.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.540
You’re an old man.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.360
Why do you like such weird hairstyle?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.220
Go and cut your hair.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.190
Go to do it.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.440
You call yourself Steel Bar Xie.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.660
Turns out it’s just for warming up.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:50.650
Since it’s a just useless

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.440
decoration,

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.360
why don’t you take it

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.330
when you study in the Shaolin Temple?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.700
What a sharp-tongued weirdo!

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.900
What a little squirt!

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.630
What the hell is going on?

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.730
Both of them are crazy!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.230
Anyway, they saved our face

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:30.360
and said it’s a tie.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.230
You’re right.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.760
There is no doubt about the result.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:35.380
Pastry King.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.870
Your bun is more delicious.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.260
Little brat.

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.430
I have never thought you would fry the buns.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.440
Our family has been specializing in

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.370
pastry for 1,600 years,

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:47.210
but has never thought of such bold idea.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.290
For that alone, you beat me.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:52.590
Where the hell did you learn this?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.400
I was born in Shanxi Province.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.650
It’s a barren place with nothing

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.200
except for wheat flour.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.180
When I was young,

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.570
I began to travel all over China,

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.360
widen my horizon

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.230
and learn to cook those that I had never eaten.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.100
I learned

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.490
how to make bun from the local

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.070
when I went to the far north.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.760
On that basis, I added some new ideas.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.350
It’s too cold there.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.470
Buns can’t made

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.850
as per the general method.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.330
So they directly

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.260
fry the buns.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.850
The land is too vast.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.440
In places that we never go,

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.040
there are often unexpected,

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.690
creative and unique customs.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.800
I always enjoy

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:40.720
seeing all kinds of cuisine

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.430
and meeting new chef friends.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.010
Pastry King,

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.000
with all due respect,

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.160
what you lack

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.210
is just what your rivals have.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.260
They always

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.650
make amazing

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.500
and impressive dishes

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.890
with ideas beyond imagination.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.170
To catch up with them,

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.330
I constantly challenge new goals.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.730
Well said, Chef Xie.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:06.860
That doesn't include you!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.470
Right! Chef Xie is absolutely right.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.120
This is our difference

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:12.770
from Dark Cooking Society.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.890
Cuisine brings people happiness.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.250
We’re working hard

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.260
day and night for this goal.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.640
What a big talk!

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:27.840
Pastry King.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:28.920
You’re Chef Xie.

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.240
I’ve made up my mind

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.950
to travel all over China to learn cooking.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.440
What?

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.680
For nearly a century,

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.350
I’m just a frog in the well

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.250
to see the sky.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.700
Talented people like you

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.200
come out in succession

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.680
in this vast land.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.710
I can’t stay in this place anymore.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.630
Chef Xie.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.390
Let’s compete ten years later.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.300
Before that,

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.020
keep the Rod of Honor for the time being.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.820
What? Ten years later?

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.140
Old chap,

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.460
how long will you live?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.230
Did you all hear me?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:10.910
I’ve been bothering you here

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.990
for some days.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:13.450
But I decided to leave

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.570
today.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.500
Do you think you can leave so easily?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.340
Luogen.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:22.710
Watch out!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:32.700
You should stay out of my business.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:34.680
Old man.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.770
If you don’t live for another ten years,

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:37.560
I’ll be very troublesome.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:56.570
He is gone.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.290
Is the old man an immortal?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.350
Young man, don’t forget

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.760
our ten-year agreement.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.940
An old hard-liner.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:11.800
Luogen.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.320
No matter how,

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:15.100
you can’t escape the work of Dark Cooking Society.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:17.740
You've put yourself in a dead end!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.030
You remember that!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.500
I’m sorry.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.800
I didn't win this round.

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.880
The rival is really a little stronger.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:34.690
It’s good enough to break even.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:35.520
Right.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.090
Just win one more round later,

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.400
we’ll win.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:38.970
But

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:40.460
if losing two rounds,

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.640
we’ll lose.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.170
And the next one

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.230
should be the woman,

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.060
right?

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:49.080
There's no one else.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:50.910
I think

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.840
that woman is totally different

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:54.830
from others.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.520
I feel particularly dangerous.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.600
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:15.680
What? It’s a loss and a draw.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.590
Right.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.970
Multicoloured Tiger Luo Ke

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:21.640
lost to Sanjie of Longzhen Restaurant.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.000
Pastry King Luogen

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.160
and Steel Bar Xie drew.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.170
It is said that Luogen run away

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.140
after the competition.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:33.440
What should we do, sir?

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:35.620
Leave him alone.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.980
Since he betrayed us,

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:41.120
his life has nothing to do with us.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.080
But sir,

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.770
what if it continues like this?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.890
Our aim is to

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:50.510
get the legendary kitchenware

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.890
while displaying our strength

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.340
to Shanghai.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.380
We can’t lose it.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.670
Isn’t that good?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.850
In the next round,

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.230
we should be able to win,

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:08.220
resulting in a draw.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.480
Xiang En

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:12.760
has never been defeated.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:14.660
In the last round,

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.540
it will be my turn.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:17.290
Mao,

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.740
I’ll defeat you

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.350
to wash off the disgrace

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.650
that you brought me.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.140
Wait and see.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.270
Your rival

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.340
will be the top expert

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.600
in Dark Cooking Society

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.960
who vowed to pay off old scores.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.940
Seven-Star Knife Lei En, come out.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.590
Or should I call you the Betrayer Lei En.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.430
I know we’ll have to compete

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.380
sooner or later.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:54.020
Or you want to run away again

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.590
just as you escape from Dark Cooking Society?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.170
I will neither run nor hide.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:01.310
Lei En.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.770
Lei En, are you OK?

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.040
Don’t worry.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:06.350
Mao,

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.930
I once told you that

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.210
I went astray on the path of cooking

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.050
for an unforgivable crime.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:16.260
To return to good

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:18.910
and destroying Dark Cooking Society,

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.180
I was determined to leave the organization.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:23.120
Dark?

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:24.850
I don't regret leaving here.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:26.920
I have no hesitation

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.260
in the struggle with Dark Cooking Society.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.160
I know.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.900
But that's not what I'm worried about.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:34.470
The rival may have investigated

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.090
your background thoroughly.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:38.600
So it’s hard to say

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.270
what despicable means they’ll use

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.090
against you?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.050
Even so, I want to win.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.560
So stupid you’re!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.420
Your talents should have helped you

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.720
get insight into the Dark Cuisine

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:52.110
and sooner or later

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.480
make you the leader.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.200
I specially arranged a venue

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.700
suitable for competing with you.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:45.830
What’s this?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:47.890
Those are people

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.730
living in the dark corner of Shanghai,

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.810
all kinds of ethnic groups.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.170
Welcome to the second competition venue.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.300
I’m the host

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.630
of this competition,

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:01.960
Malin.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:03.770
She’s really a young lady in big city.

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:05.620
She has a completely different vibe.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.000
Which aspect do you mean?

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.230
It hurts.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.540
Let’s take a look

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:11.840
at the food materials first.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.220
Please open the bottom.

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:24.480
The floor is open.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.410
I’ll compete with you

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.800
with the seafood that you do best.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.240
They did investigate

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.550
Lei En in advance.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.240
But if so,

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.980
why does she choose the seafood that Lei En is good at?

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:44.260
I don’t know

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:46.220
But there are two possibilities.

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:47.740
Two possibilities.

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:49.570
The first is that she is confident

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:50.640
that he can cook more delicious seafood

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.780
than Lei En.

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:56.640
Or there is a trap.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.970
You’re so naive

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.590
that can’t realize our ambition

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.580
to dominate Dark Cooking Society.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.740
I don't think you have a chance to win.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.390
I made a mistake

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:10.630
because of your arrogance.

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:13.520
I have sworn that

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.460
I will never let the same mistake

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.400
happen again.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.380
The water is cut in half.

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.090
This is

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.250
my determination.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.090
Finished.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.220
Seven-Star Raw Cuttlefish Slices.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.420
The cuttlefish in the water

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.170
turns into slices in an instant.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.520
It’s amazing.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:02.900
It can even cut water in half.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.420
The Seven-Star Knife

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.200
are indeed the unique mysterious knife.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.190
Lei En’s cutting skills

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.840
are really excellent.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.360
I, Lei En,

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:13.830
have nothing to ask for in the world.

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.910
I only hope

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.240
to improve my knife skills wholeheartedly.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.160
So you’re too naive.

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:30.930
You're still

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.610
so concerned about it.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:33.170
What?

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:34.760
She knows.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.070
She knew Lei En’s mistake.

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.120
If you are really so cowardly,

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.420
I'm afraid you can't face up to

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.810
what will appear in front of you.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.950
That is...

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.120
Isn’t it the Seven-Star Knife.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.470
I’m Xiang En,

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.160
Ten Feet of Blue in Dark Cooking Society.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:06.580
How come!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:07.790
How can that be?

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.020
You didn’t expect

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.280
someone has the same

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:13.650
Cold-Blood Seven-Star Knife as you.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.830
Here is an unexpected turn.

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.520
It’s said that there is only a pair of Seven-Star Knives.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.010
Now, another pair appears.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:36.230
I don’t understand

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:37.890
why you have one?

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.920
No wonder you’re shocked.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.830
This pair of Seven-Star Knives

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.550
knows clearly what you committed.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:50.020
They’re a complete pair of Seven-Star Knives.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:51.790
Later, you’ll believe

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.060
what I said.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.830
Seven-Star Knife Cuts!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:17.130
(Seven-Star Knife Cuts)

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.320
That’s...

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:26.610
So incredible!

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.190
The cut is closed slowly.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.770
This is the appetizer.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:35.150
Though not salted,

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.230
the fresh spawn

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.650
tastes more delicious than caviar.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:40.100
The cutting technique is bold,

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.480
agile and exquisite.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.550
It’s full of mysteries.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.110
It’s too early to be surprised.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:53.870
What?

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:59.050
The sturgeon,

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.460
being cut on the belly,

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.670
is swimming in the water.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.670
It's unbelievable!

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:04.590
How could this be?

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:05.760
I heard that

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:06.510
if a creature is cut

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:07.780
in a flash,

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.270
the cut can be healed

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:11.670
before the cut cells sense it.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.190
Only the Seven-Star Knife

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:17.470
could do this.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:19.840
OK!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.330
The rivals are Seven-Star Knife Lei En,

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:22.240
who bears the heavy sin

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.070
and tries to destroy

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.240
Dark Cooking Society,

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:27.770
and Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En,

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.230
who is self-confident and

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.620
owns the first-class technology of Dark Cuisine.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.470
Round three

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.430
is about to begin.

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:40.540
Incredible.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.730
There are two pairs of Seven-Star Knives.

00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:45.390
What will happen to this round?

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:47.490
And what crime

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:48.600
did Lei En commit?

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.936
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:20.880
There should be only one set of
Seven-Star Knives in the world, but why?

00:23:21.277 --> 00:23:23.397
Lei En was extremely upset.

00:23:23.397 --> 00:23:27.324
At that moment, Xiang En told us
Lei En's horrible mistake in the past.

00:23:27.850 --> 00:23:29.370
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.621 --> 00:23:32.122
Wake Up Lei En! The Destiny of A Chef

00:23:32.337 --> 00:23:33.499
It will definitely be interesting!
